  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the antisemitic_conspiracy_scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene depicting the World Trade Center during the 9/11 attacks, which is juxtaposed with the text 'Jewish invention' to falsely imply Jewish people were responsible for the attacks. This projection is implicit, as the meme uses the visual of destruction to associate the user (as a viewer) with the hateful narrative, making the viewer complicit in the antisemitic projection by consuming the image. The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the framing of the image and text forces the viewer to confront the hateful message, projecting the user onto the scene as an unwitting participant in the antisemitic conspiracy theory.",
